#[ Supported ]

##[ Heading ]

```tm
# heading

#[ heading ]
#[ heading ]{}
```

##[ Outline ]

```tm
- outline
- (x) checked
1. sorted

- outline
- outline :{}
- (x) checked
- (x) checked :{}
-. sorted
```

##[ Link ]

```tm
[display](path)
[[wikilink]]

@link(file:path)[display]
@link(target:"ref:file_name")
```

##[ Embed ]

```tm
![embed](path)
![[embed]]

@embed[embed](path:path)
@embed(ref:file_name)
```

##[ Blockquote ]

```tm
> blockquote

@blockquote
[ blockquote ]
```

##[ Callout ]

```tm
> [!info] Title
>
> Contents

@callout(info, title: Title)
[ Contents ]
```

```tm
\`\`\`tm
\`\`\`

@codeblock(tm)[
]
\`\`\`(tm)
\`\`\`
\`\`\`tm
\`\`\`
```

```tm
**strong**
*siranai*
==marker==
_torikesi_
`nanikore?`
```

